## Late Payment Policy

Invoices remaining unpaid after the due date will be subject to:

- A fixed late payment fee of **{{ config.late_payment_fee | aud }}** per invoice, and
- Interest at the ATO General Interest Charge (GIC) rate plus **{{ config.late_payment_margin }}%** per annum,
  calculated and compounded daily from the due date until payment is received in full.
